{"content_hash": "dff1f5ecbab61366", "version_id": 875, "article_id": 88, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Storage Hunter Simulator brings garage-auction bidding to consoles on November 24", "title_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》11月24日登陆主机，车库拍卖搬上手柄", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221947", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606813907291-d86efa9b94db?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8cGxheXN0YXRpb24lMjB4Ym94JTIwc2VyaWVzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM4NDI2NTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Charles Sims on Unsplash", "author": "Charles Sims", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@1charlessims?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/white-and-black-box-on-white-table-QHha7JOJYnw?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(255, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(293, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fcb7069c8333"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-05", "word_count": 270, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Bargain hunters who prefer a controller to a clipboard are in luck: Storage Hunter Simulator arrives on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, priced at $24.99. A beefier edition bundles five themed DLC packs.", "lead_zh": "习惯用手柄而不是记账板的捡漏玩家有福了：《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。另有一个更丰富的版本，打包了五个主题DLC。", "preview": "Storage Hunter Simulator, the auction-driven treasure-hunting title, will reach PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, carr", "preview_zh": "以拍卖为核心的寻宝游戏《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。想要更完整拍卖体验的玩家，可以选择《仓库猎人模拟器：概不退款版》，该版本包含游戏本体和扩展通行证，通行证内含五个主题DLC：《后院", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 858, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 115.95, "size_bytes": 696672, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 316, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 119.95, "size_bytes": 720720, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 316, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 128.125, "size_bytes": 769680, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 316, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 110.8, "size_bytes": 665712, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 316, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 118.55, "size_bytes": 712224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 316, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c9cea96/content/data/versions/875.json", "paragraphs": ["Storage Hunter Simulator, the auction-driven treasure-hunting title, will reach PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, carrying a $24.99 price tag. Players eager for the fuller auction experience may instead opt for Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition, which pairs the base game with an expansion pass encompassing five themed DLC packs — the Backyard Starter Pack, the Lights, Camera, Action! Pack, the This Thing's Gotta Be Worth Millions Pack, the Mom Said Throw It Out Pack and the Collectibles Showcase Pack. That edition launches across all platforms, PC included, at $34.99, while the expansion pass alone can be had for $16.99.", "At its core the game casts players as itinerant bidders, crisscrossing town auctions to outmanoeuvre rivals for the contents of garages, storage lockers and shipping containers. Every lot conceals a gamble. Treasure must be sifted from junk, margins calculated, and a fledgling business coaxed into growth. Thousands of distinct items await discovery; experts can be hired to appraise their worth, with tools for self-valuation unlocked as the operation expands. Successful hunters eventually acquire a pawnshop and manage resources through tool investment, facility upgrades and staff hires.", "Those reluctant to hunt alone can recruit up to three friends for a drop-in, drop-out cooperative romp. Teams share a single bank account, so coordination before the bidding starts proves prudent; members may attend the same auction or split up to maximise returns. Customisable avatars, seven drivable vehicles, fuel and trunk management, appraisal systems, a pawnshop network and an open world spanning five regions round out the feature set, alongside easy and hard modes and achievements to show off."], "paragraphs_zh": ["以拍卖为核心的寻宝游戏《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。想要更完整拍卖体验的玩家，可以选择《仓库猎人模拟器：概不退款版》，该版本包含游戏本体和扩展通行证，通行证内含五个主题DLC：《后院入门包》《灯光、摄影机、开拍！包》《这玩意儿肯定值百万包》《妈妈说该把它扔了包》以及《收藏品展示包》。该版本将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元；扩展通行证也可单独购买，售价16.99美元。", "游戏的核心是让玩家扮演四处奔波的竞拍者，穿梭于城镇各场拍卖会，与其他买家争夺车库、储物间和集装箱里的物品。每一批货都是一场赌博：要从垃圾里挑出宝贝，算清利润空间，再把刚起步的生意一点点做大。游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现，玩家可以聘请专家鉴定价值，随着业务扩张逐步解锁自行估价的工具。成功的寻宝者最终会买下典当行，并通过投资工具、升级设施和雇用员工来管理资源。", "不想独自寻宝的玩家可以邀请最多三位好友，体验随时加入、随时退出的合作模式。团队成员共用一个银行账户，所以拍卖开始前最好先商量好计划；成员可以参加同一场拍卖，也可以分头前往不同现场以最大化收益。可自定义的角色外观、七种可驾驶载具、后备箱空间与燃油管理、鉴定系统、典当行网络，以及横跨五个区域的开放世界，共同构成了游戏特色，此外还有轻松与困难两种模式以及可炫耀的战绩成就。"], "body": "Storage Hunter Simulator, the auction-driven treasure-hunting title, will reach PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, carrying a $24.99 price tag. Players eager for the fuller auction experience may instead opt for Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition, which pairs the base game with an expansion pass encompassing five themed DLC packs — the Backyard Starter Pack, the Lights, Camera, Action! Pack, the This Thing's Gotta Be Worth Millions Pack, the Mom Said Throw It Out Pack and the Collectibles Showcase Pack. That edition launches across all platforms, PC included, at $34.99, while the expansion pass alone can be had for $16.99.\n\nAt its core the game casts players as itinerant bidders, crisscrossing town auctions to outmanoeuvre rivals for the contents of garages, storage lockers and shipping containers. Every lot conceals a gamble. Treasure must be sifted from junk, margins calculated, and a fledgling business coaxed into growth. Thousands of distinct items await discovery; experts can be hired to appraise their worth, with tools for self-valuation unlocked as the operation expands. Successful hunters eventually acquire a pawnshop and manage resources through tool investment, facility upgrades and staff hires.\n\nThose reluctant to hunt alone can recruit up to three friends for a drop-in, drop-out cooperative romp. Teams share a single bank account, so coordination before the bidding starts proves prudent; members may attend the same auction or split up to maximise returns. Customisable avatars, seven drivable vehicles, fuel and trunk management, appraisal systems, a pawnshop network and an open world spanning five regions round out the feature set, alongside easy and hard modes and achievements to show off.", "body_zh": "以拍卖为核心的寻宝游戏《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。想要更完整拍卖体验的玩家，可以选择《仓库猎人模拟器：概不退款版》，该版本包含游戏本体和扩展通行证，通行证内含五个主题DLC：《后院入门包》《灯光、摄影机、开拍！包》《这玩意儿肯定值百万包》《妈妈说该把它扔了包》以及《收藏品展示包》。该版本将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元；扩展通行证也可单独购买，售价16.99美元。\n\n游戏的核心是让玩家扮演四处奔波的竞拍者，穿梭于城镇各场拍卖会，与其他买家争夺车库、储物间和集装箱里的物品。每一批货都是一场赌博：要从垃圾里挑出宝贝，算清利润空间，再把刚起步的生意一点点做大。游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现，玩家可以聘请专家鉴定价值，随着业务扩张逐步解锁自行估价的工具。成功的寻宝者最终会买下典当行，并通过投资工具、升级设施和雇用员工来管理资源。\n\n不想独自寻宝的玩家可以邀请最多三位好友，体验随时加入、随时退出的合作模式。团队成员共用一个银行账户，所以拍卖开始前最好先商量好计划；成员可以参加同一场拍卖，也可以分头前往不同现场以最大化收益。可自定义的角色外观、七种可驾驶载具、后备箱空间与燃油管理、鉴定系统、典当行网络，以及横跨五个区域的开放世界，共同构成了游戏特色，此外还有轻松与困难两种模式以及可炫耀的战绩成就。", "text": "Storage Hunter Simulator, the auction-driven treasure-hunting title, will reach PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, carrying a $24.99 price tag. Players eager for the fuller auction experience may instead opt for Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition, which pairs the base game with an expansion pass encompassing five themed DLC packs — the Backyard Starter Pack, the Lights, Camera, Action! Pack, the This Thing's Gotta Be Worth Millions Pack, the Mom Said Throw It Out Pack and the Collectibles Showcase Pack. That edition launches across all platforms, PC included, at $34.99, while the expansion pass alone can be had for $16.99. At its core the game casts players as itinerant bidders, crisscrossing town auctions to outmanoeuvre rivals for the contents of garages, storage lockers and shipping containers. Every lot conceals a gamble. Treasure must be sifted from junk, margins calculated, and a fledgling business coaxed into growth. Thousands of distinct items await discovery; experts can be hired to appraise their worth, with tools for self-valuation unlocked as the operation expands. Successful hunters eventually acquire a pawnshop and manage resources through tool investment, facility upgrades and staff hires. Those reluctant to hunt alone can recruit up to three friends for a drop-in, drop-out cooperative romp. Teams share a single bank account, so coordination before the bidding starts proves prudent; members may attend the same auction or split up to maximise returns. Customisable avatars, seven drivable vehicles, fuel and trunk management, appraisal systems, a pawnshop network and an open world spanning five regions round out the feature set, alongside easy and hard modes and achievements to show off.", "vocab": [{"word": "outmanoeuvre", "pos": "verb", "zh": "智胜；以策略压过", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 outmaneuver，常用于竞争语境", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "appraise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "鉴定；估价", "note": "与 apprise（告知）易混，注意区分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drop-in, drop-out", "pos": "adj", "zh": "可随时加入退出的", "note": "多用于多人合作游戏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cooperative romp", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "轻松热闹的合作冒险", "note": "romp 指轻松欢快的活动", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "encompass", "pos": "verb", "zh": "包含；涵盖", "note": "比 include 更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "itinerant", "pos": "adj", "zh": "四处奔波的；流动的", "note": "常修饰 worker、musician 等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fledgling", "pos": "adj", "zh": "刚起步的；羽翼未丰的", "note": "常搭配 business、career", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "conceal", "pos": "verb", "zh": "隐藏；暗藏", "note": "正式用词，较 hide 更书面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sift", "pos": "verb", "zh": "筛选；仔细翻找", "note": "sift A from B 表示从B中挑出A", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "maximise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使最大化", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 maximize", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "round out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "使完整；补足", "note": "round out the feature set 意为完善功能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "prudent", "pos": "adj", "zh": "审慎的；明智的", "note": "常用于 it proves prudent to do sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price tag", "pos": "noun", "zh": "标价；价格", "note": "carry a price tag of 表示售价为", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pawnshop", "pos": "noun", "zh": "典当行", "note": "游戏中的经营场所", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-05T01:37:37.647708", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Storage", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.625, "sm": 275, "em": 625, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Hunter", "s": 0.625, "e": 0.95, "sm": 625, "em": 949, "cs": 8, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w"